    "biography": "<p>Undercover Titanian Scientist</p><p><strong>Morph:</strong> Bouncer</p><p><strong>Motivations:</strong> +Science +Singularity Seeking +Technosocialism</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Academics: Neuroscience (Forking) 80, Blades 45, Fray 50, Free Fall 40, Infosec 55, Interest: Neuroscience Projects 50, Interfacing 45, Kinesics 60, Language (Native): Japanese 90, Language: Skandinaviska 80, Medicine: Resleeving 55, Perception 50, Persuasion 50, Programming 40, Psychosurgery 80, Research 70</p><p><strong>Implants:</strong> Basic Biomods, Basic Mesh Inserts, Cortical Stack, Grip Pads, Oxygen Reserve, Prehensile Feet</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Adaptability (Lvl 1), Allies, Ego Plasticity (Lvl 1), Limber (Lvl 1), Trauma Tolerance (Lvl 1)</p><p><strong>Gear:</strong> Chameleon Cloak, Creepy Bot</p><p><strong>melee:</strong> Wasp Knife 45 (AP −1, DV 1d10 + 3) with BTX-2.</p><p><strong>Armor:</strong> 5/5 (Light Vacsuit)</p><p><strong>Appearance:</strong> Rokuzawa's gender identity is female, but she's sleeved into a male Asian bouncer. Like all of the Houngan, she wears off-white researcher's coveralls with Nazon's personal veve (corrupted from that of Papa Legba) on the chest.</p><p><strong>Roleplaying:</strong> Rokuzawa is a daring and unorthodox researcher who's devoted herself to exploring the limits of transhuman identity. But with Nine Lives, she's in over her head. At this point, she just wants to get out of here. Rokuzawa's alpha could trash the reps of any scientist or autonomist characters who go back on a deal to get her off station. She'll use this as leverage when bargaining.</p><p><em>Printed: INIT 6, SPD 1, LUC 30, TT 6, IR 60, DUR 40, WT 8, DR 60.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase The Devotees, p. 27.</em></p>",
    "notes": "",
    "details": {
      "motivations": "+Science +Singularity Seeking +Technosocialism"
    }
  },
