        },
        "movement": "4/20",
        "implants": "Basic Biomods, Basic Mesh Inserts, Cortical Stack, Grip Pads, Oxygen Reserve, Prehensile Feet",
        "advantages": "Limber (Level 1) trait, +5 COO, +5 SOM, +5 to one other aptitude of the player’s choice",
